    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>293492</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ここにキャベツと大根の
種を植えました</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We've planted radish
and cabbage here.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>293584</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>天地に集える数多の精よ、
恵みとなり、
我が食物の糧となれ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Myriad spirits who dwell in
heaven and earth, become
our blessing and sustenance!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>293632</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おおっ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ooh...!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>293768</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>えっと……精霊の力を
ちょっとお借りしてみました</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Umm... So, I just borrowed
the power of the spirits.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>293768</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>たぶん、
これで土に栄養がいって、
早く作物が育つと……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It should make the
soil healthy so the
crops grow faster...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>293848</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>では、いつもより早く
収穫ができるのですね？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Then, we'll be able to harvest them
much sooner than we usually would?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>293896</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>えぇ、たぶん</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yes, most likely.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>293980</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>これで、また少し
冬の間の備蓄ができるわ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>With this, we'll have a little
more stocked up for winter.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294052</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ええ。もう少し、
様子を見てみましょう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yes. Now we just have
to see how it turns out.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294160</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あっ、あっちもお願い！
ほうれん草とブロッコリーが
植えてあるから！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, please do these, too!
It's spinach and broccoli!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294220</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あ、ま、待ってください！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ah, okay, just a moment!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294304</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ここにキャベツと大根の
種を植えたけど……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>There are cabbages and
radishes planted here, but...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294376</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>この辺りは、
土が痩せてるからね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The soil here isn't
very healthy, so...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294468</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あまり畑には
向いてないんですね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, so it's not really the
best soil for planting...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294468</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……どうしましょう……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Um, what should I do...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294528</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どうしようかね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, we're at a loss, too...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294592</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どうしようかしらねぇ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I wonder what we can do...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>294680</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>と、とにかく、
肥やしと水をやって、
地道に育てましょう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>W-Well, um, let's
water and fertilize
them, at least.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
